ggg (0.20.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * The badge builder gains a light theme: a header toggle between the dark and
    a Catppuccin Latte palette, following the system preference and remembered.
  * The gallery wears the project mark and ends with the builder's footer:
    version, build revision, source, README, API docs, credits and license.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:35:00 +0100

ggg (0.19.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * The badge builder autocompletes logos and theme colors, shows a preview per
    finish, offers starting points, copies URL, Markdown and HTML snippets and
    ends with a footer naming the version, build revision, license and docs.
  * Serve the project mark at /logo.svg and link the gallery from the builder.
  * Default corners are slightly rounder: 3.5px, drawn as 3.82px.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:05:00 +0100

